  "contentHtml": "\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"page-hero listen-hero\">\n      <div class=\"container reveal\">\n        <span class=\"section-kicker\">Title Track Archive</span>\n        <h1 class=\"section-title\">Listen</h1>\n        <p class=\"section-desc\">AFTER MIDNIGHT부터 REST까지. NIGHT의 각 시대를 대표한 타이틀곡과 앨범의 기록을 만나보세요.</p>\n        <nav class=\"listen-jump-nav\" aria-label=\"음악 아카이브 바로가기\"><a href=\"#take-it-back\">음원 듣기</a><a href=\"discography.html\">DISCOGRAPHY ↗</a><a href=\"highlight-medley.html\">HIGHLIGHT MEDLEY ↗</a></nav>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section listen-section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"listen-list\">\n<article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"next-time\"><div class=\"listen-number\">01</div><div class=\"listen-info\"><div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>REST</span><span>2029.11.02 · DIGITAL SINGLE</span></div><h2>NEXT TIME</h2><p class=\"archive-note\">이 곡은 공식 사이트 내 스트리밍을 지원하지 않습니다. 앨범 정보는 ALBUM ARCHIVE에서 확인하세요.</p><a class=\"listen-album-link\" href=\"discography.html#rest\">ALBUM ARCHIVE ↗</a></div></article>\n<article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"paradise\"><div class=\"listen-number\">02</div><div class=\"listen-info\"><div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>PARADOX</span><span>2029.08.27 · ALBUM</span></div><h2>PARADISE</h2><p class=\"archive-note\">이 곡은 공식 사이트 내 스트리밍을 지원하지 않습니다. 앨범 정보는 ALBUM ARCHIVE에서 확인하세요.</p><a class=\"listen-album-link\" href=\"discography.html#paradox\">ALBUM ARCHIVE ↗</a></div></article>\n<article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"black-night\"><div class=\"listen-number\">03</div><div class=\"listen-info\"><div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>NIGHTMARE</span><span>2029.02.23 · ALBUM</span></div><h2>BLACK NIGHT</h2><p class=\"archive-note\">이 곡은 공식 사이트 내 스트리밍을 지원하지 않습니다. 앨범 정보는 ALBUM ARCHIVE에서 확인하세요.</p><a class=\"listen-album-link\" href=\"discography.html#nightmare\">ALBUM ARCHIVE ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"take-it-back\"><div class=\"listen-number\">04</div><div class=\"listen-info\"><div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>PERSONA</span><span>2028.08.21 · MINI ALBUM</span></div><h2>탈환 (TAKE IT BACK)</h2><audio controls controlsList=\"nodownload\" preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"탈환 (TAKE IT BACK) 재생\"><source src=\"assets/audio/take-it-back.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio><a class=\"listen-album-link\" href=\"discography.html#persona\">ALBUM ARCHIVE ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"between\"><div class=\"listen-number\">05</div><div class=\"listen-info\"><div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>WINGS</span><span>2028.02.01 · MINI ALBUM</span></div><h2>경계 (BETWEEN)</h2><audio controls controlsList=\"nodownload\" preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"경계 (BETWEEN) 재생\"><source src=\"assets/audio/between.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio><a class=\"listen-album-link\" href=\"discography.html#wings\">ALBUM ARCHIVE ↗</a></div></article>\n<article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"beom\">\n  <div class=\"listen-number\">06</div>\n  <div class=\"listen-info\">\n    <div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>SENSATIONAL</span><span>2027.10.01 · MINI ALBUM</span></div>\n    <h2>범(虎)</h2>\n    <audio controls controlsList=\"nodownload\" preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"범(虎) 재생\">\n      <source src=\"assets/audio/beom.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\n      Your browser does not support the audio element.\n    </audio>\n  <a class=\"listen-album-link\" href=\"discography.html#sensational\">ALBUM ARCHIVE ↗</a></div></article>\n<article class=\"listen-card reveal\" id=\"restart\">\n  <div class=\"listen-number\">07</div>\n  <div class=\"listen-info\">\n    <div class=\"listen-meta\"><span>INFINITY</span><span>2027.08.01 · MINI ALBUM</span></div>\n    <h2>RESTART</h2>\n    <audio controls controlsList=\"nodownload\" preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"RESTART 재생\">\n      <source src=\"assets/audio/re